{"id":"huntik:page:8706","page_id":8706,"title":"Auraforce","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Auraforce is a powerful offensive spell used by members of the Blood Spiral that creates a blue or purple aura which sends out a large burst or wave of energy.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:Auraforce.png","wikitext":"File:Auraforce.png","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Violet \n Blue","wikitext":"Violet <br> Blue","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Offensive","wikitext":"Offensive","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Kiel\nRassimov \n Tantras \nUnnamed Suit 002 (TCG)","wikitext":"[[Kiel]]<br>[[Rassimov]] <br/> [[Tantras]] <br/>[[Unnamed Suit 002]] ([[TCG:LGS-072|TCG]])","links":[{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Tantras","label":"Tantras","target_id":"huntik:page:4559","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tantras","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4559"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 002","label":"Unnamed Suit 002","target_id":"huntik:page:17518","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_002","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17518"},{"target_title":"TCG:LGS-072","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:9007","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:LGS-072","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A9007"}]},"first":{"text":"\"Memory Lane\"","wikitext":"\"[[Memory Lane]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:Auraforce.png","value_text":"File:Auraforce.png","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Violet <br> Blue","value_text":"Violet \n Blue","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Offensive","value_text":"Offensive","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Kiel]]<br>[[Rassimov]] <br/> [[Tantras]] <br/>[[Unnamed Suit 002]] ([[TCG:LGS-072|TCG]])","value_text":"Kiel\nRassimov \n Tantras \nUnnamed Suit 002 (TCG)","links":[{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Tantras","label":"Tantras","target_id":"huntik:page:4559","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tantras","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4559"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 002","label":"Unnamed Suit 002","target_id":"huntik:page:17518","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_002","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17518"},{"target_title":"TCG:LGS-072","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:9007","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:LGS-072","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A9007"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Memory Lane]]\"","value_text":"\"Memory Lane\"","links":[{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"}]}],"start":0,"end":223}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"[[Rassimov]] attempted to use Auraforce against [[Lok Lambert]] on [[Atlantis]] during the search for the [[Amulet of Will]]. Before he could cast it at Lok, the young seeker used [[Hyperstride]] to send himself towards Rassimov. {{Source|Coming of Age}}\n\nAuraforce was used by [[Tantras]] while fighting the Huntik Team in the streets of Venice. The large wave of energy managed to knock back [[Dante Vale]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\nKiel used the spell inside The Cloisters to knock back Sophie and Lok. {{Source|The Casterwill Connection}} \n\nBy the entrance of the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]], Rassimov used Auraforce to make some Organization personnel working on the Tomb kneel. {{Source|Rassimov's Secret}} \n\nA blue-aura version of this spell was used by [[unnamed Suit 002]] to attack a [[Tolivane]]. {{source|LGS-072}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"Rassimov attempted to use Auraforce against Lok Lambert on Atlantis during the search for the Amulet of Will. Before he could cast it at Lok, the young seeker used Hyperstride to send himself towards Rassimov. [Coming of Age]\n\nAuraforce was used by Tantras while fighting the Huntik Team in the streets of Venice. The large wave of energy managed to knock back Dante Vale and Sophie Casterwill. [Boys Will Be Seekers]\n\nKiel used the spell inside The Cloisters to knock back Sophie and Lok. [The Casterwill Connection] \n\nBy the entrance of the Tomb of Nefertiti, Rassimov used Auraforce to make some Organization personnel working on the Tomb kneel. [Rassimov's Secret] \n\nA blue-aura version of this spell was used by unnamed Suit 002 to attack a Tolivane. [LGS-072]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Force-aura\n|POR=Aura-Força, Força-Aurea}}\n\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":"French: Force-aura\nPortuguese: Aura-Força, Força-Aurea"}],"full_text":"Auraforce is a powerful offensive spell used by members of the Blood Spiral that creates a blue or purple aura which sends out a large burst or wave of energy.\n\n== History ==\nRassimov attempted to use Auraforce against Lok Lambert on Atlantis during the search for the Amulet of Will. Before he could cast it at Lok, the young seeker used Hyperstride to send himself towards Rassimov. [Coming of Age]\n\nAuraforce was used by Tantras while fighting the Huntik Team in the streets of Venice. The large wave of energy managed to knock back Dante Vale and Sophie Casterwill. [Boys Will Be Seekers]\n\nKiel used the spell inside The Cloisters to knock back Sophie and Lok. [The Casterwill Connection] \n\nBy the entrance of the Tomb of Nefertiti, Rassimov used Auraforce to make some Organization personnel working on the Tomb kneel. [Rassimov's Secret] \n\nA blue-aura version of this spell was used by unnamed Suit 002 to attack a Tolivane. [LGS-072]\n\n==International Names==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:Auraforce.png\n| aura  = Violet <br> Blue\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Kiel]]<br>[[Rassimov]] <br/> [[Tantras]] <br/>[[Unnamed Suit 002]] ([[TCG:LGS-072|TCG]])\n| first = \"[[Memory Lane]]\"\n}}\n'''Auraforce''' is a powerful offensive spell used by members of the [[Blood Spiral]] that creates a blue or purple aura which sends out a large burst or wave of energy.\n\n== History ==\n[[Rassimov]] attempted to use Auraforce against [[Lok Lambert]] on [[Atlantis]] during the search for the [[Amulet of Will]]. Before he could cast it at Lok, the young seeker used [[Hyperstride]] to send himself towards Rassimov. {{Source|Coming of Age}}\n\nAuraforce was used by [[Tantras]] while fighting the Huntik Team in the streets of Venice. The large wave of energy managed to knock back [[Dante Vale]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}\n\nKiel used the spell inside The Cloisters to knock back Sophie and Lok. {{Source|The Casterwill Connection}} \n\nBy the entrance of the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]], Rassimov used Auraforce to make some Organization personnel working on the Tomb kneel. {{Source|Rassimov's Secret}} \n\nA blue-aura version of this spell was used by [[unnamed Suit 002]] to attack a [[Tolivane]]. {{source|LGS-072}}\n\n{{clear}}\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Force-aura\n|POR=Aura-Força, Força-Aurea}}\n\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Blue-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Blue-aura spells","Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic","Violet-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Tantras","label":"Tantras","target_id":"huntik:page:4559","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tantras","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4559"},{"target_title":"Unnamed Suit 002","label":"Unnamed Suit 002","target_id":"huntik:page:17518","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Unnamed_Suit_002","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17518"},{"target_title":"TCG:LGS-072","label":"TCG","target_id":"huntik:page:9007","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:LGS-072","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A9007"},{"target_title":"Memory Lane","label":"Memory Lane","target_id":"huntik:page:5037","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Memory_Lane","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5037"},{"target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_id":"huntik:page:3288","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fando